extAlignment":"left"},{"id":"AQ0nyEOM0KzjLmz-oq18V","textSize":24,"fillColor":"transparent","height":120,"position":{"x":8680,"y":5070},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":1840,"text":"Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consetetur sadipscing elitr, sed diam nonumy eirmod tempor invidunt ut labore et dolore magna aliquyam erat, sed diam voluptua. At vero eos et accusam et justo duo dolores et ea rebum. Stet clita kasd gubergren, no sea takimata sanctus est Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consetetur sadipscing elitr, sed diam nonumy eirmod tempor invidunt ut labore et dolore magna aliquyam erat, sed diam volu","attachedFrame":"g6psBLe1EDh1E2jYo14XO"},{"id":"mmDQaJW2pSFkzwh0HLEPV","textSize":32,"textBold":true,"fillColor":"#00bcd4","height":80,"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":280,"position":{"x":9700,"y":5390},"text":"Milestone F","attachedFrame":"g6psBLe1EDh1E2jYo14XO"},{"id":"8MlrC1ifLMDQA1pBmixon","fillColor":"#d7dee2","height":140,"position":{"x":8640,"y":4770},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":60,"text":"","textColor":"#8e3013","textFontFamily":"Inter","attachedFrame":"g6psBLe1EDh1E2jYo14XO","textSize":64},{"id":"vuIIIxREe8gaDATkkdhEd","fillColor":"#d7dee2","height":140,"position":{"x":8700,"y":4770},"type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","width":1860,"text":"Project Timeline","textSize":64,"textBold":true,"textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"g6psBLe1EDh1E2jYo14XO"},{"id":"si5wEjlSDV8bB5EgMxHTS","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10720,"y":4770},"width":1720,"height":120,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Facilitation guide","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"nK5etKMA3IsfGy58xzeEU","textSize":56,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"zX9pdPVZrc_5CQtG9BtrT","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":10740,"y":4940},"width":1680,"height":1060,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"🚀 Project Timeline: How it works in 4 steps\n\n🎯 Purpose: Plan a project along its milestones and make dependencies visible.\n\n1. Describe the project (5 min)\nAction: Replace the placeholder text with goal, scope and end date.\n\n2. Set milestones (15 min)\nAction: Rename Milestones A–F with real results and dates.\nRule: A milestone is a result, not an activity (\"Pilot live\", not \"Testing\").\n\n3. Add details (15 min)\nAction: Use the list below a milestone for tasks, owners and risks.\n\n4. Check and agree (10 min)\nAction: Walk the timeline from left to right: is it realistic? What depends on what?\nGoal: A timeline everyone commits to.\n\n🛠️ Your role as facilitator\nReality check: Ask for buffers between milestones.\nClarifier: Turn vague dates into concrete ones.\nKeeper: Revisit the board in each status meeting.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"nK5etKMA3IsfGy58xzeEU","textSize":30,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"NCjHRFyglGGSSBV7ggGeu","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4770},"width":1920,"height":120,"fillColor":"#ff5722","text":"METADATEN · T09 · wird vor Veröffentlichung entfernt","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"pKpd3NbXgd8g9hZOFwLAI","textSize":44,"textColor":"#ffffff","textBold":true},{"id":"LA11G4xLZwFqspFjH0nhI","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":4910},"width":1920,"height":130,"fillColor":"transparent","text":"Template-ID: T09   ·   Datei: T09_project-timeline.en.nwb   ·   Board-Format: v2 (Infinite Canvas)\nQuelle: Schnellstart_Paket.nwb (= Schnellstart_Templates.nwb) › Rahmen 8\nAusfüllen: In „Ihr Eintrag\" eigenen Text schreiben oder ✓ setzen, um den Vorschlag zu übernehmen. Leer = noch offen.","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFrame":"pKpd3NbXgd8g9hZOFwLAI","textSize":22,"textColor":"#000000"},{"id":"GI5bQ24WOrT7-Zo0hmMCH","type":"shape","kind":"rectangle","position":{"x":12640,"y":5060},"width":430,"height":60,"fillColor":"#607d8b","text":"Feld","textFontFamily":"Inter","textAlignment":"left","attachedFram